0A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER',mo(`- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: ${u.swept||'none yet'}\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: ${u.frontier}`));\nif(u.next)replaceBody('## 12. NEXT FOCUS',mo(u.next));\nif(u.dims)replaceBody('## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)',mo(u.dims));\nfs.writeFileSync(p,s);console.log('strategy updated');\nEOF\ncat > /tmp/opus-lineage-helper/u1.json <<'EOF'\n{\"completed\":[[\"F-1-001\",\"correctness\",\"PASS\",\"1\",\"2 P2: claude stream-json timing unverified; post-exit lineage block splits research lineage id\"]],\n\"counts\":[0,0,2],\"delta\":\"+0 P0, +0 P1, +2 P2\",\n\"worked\":[\"Reading the review ledger frame and the projection side by side settled the claimedTimestamp question in one pass (iteration 1)\"],\n\"failed\":[\"Looking for a real claude stream-json log: none on disk, every claude log predates the switch (iteration 1)\"],\n\"ruledOut\":[\"Review frame skew always zero: the frame keeps the model's record stamp (iteration 1, evidence: deep-review-state-contract.ts:290)\"],\n\"frontier\":\"F-1-001 (security next), F-1-003, F-1-005, F-2-006 (admitted iteration 1)\",\n\"next\":\"F-1-001 security: untrusted lineage stdout parsing in fanout-salvage.cjs and the runner's config rewrite in fanout-run.cjs.\"}\nEOF\nnode /tmp/opus-lineage-helper/strat.cjs /tmp/opus-lineage-helper/u1.json && sed -n '/## 6. COMPLETED/,/## 8/p' specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/opus/deep-review-strategy.md","description":"Write strategy helper and apply iteration 1 update"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":897,"cache_read_input_tokens":167896,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":897},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inferenc