n, native-only config returns early without spawning. Step 5 exits 3 with no side effec\n68:- Captured stdout and exit status for every command run in this section.\n76:- Pool worker throws instead of settling: pool fails entirely rather than reporting per-item status.\n78:- `--status` changes the ledger or creates a file: the status branch no longer returns before the run's setup.\n79:- `--stop` exits 2 with the lineage under `survivors`: the lineage's process group did not end within the 10-second confirm window, or its `spawned` row names a stale pid.\n80:- `--stop` exits 3 with a validation error: it was run without the run's own arguments, which it needs to validate the run and build each rerun command.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013HfJCJ4V5iimx6SJBH5aVT","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
