{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChEjVi36P2EQUfWQVYtux","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KHFD5TXEkahCERHWY33UJu","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration/specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/opus/iterations/iteration-016.md","content":"# Iteration 016 - Frontier node F-2-006: maintainability\n\n## Dispatcher\n- Lineage: opus (fan-out), session fanout-opus-1795201537192-sq1ivw, generation 1\n- Frontier node: F-2-006 (depth 2), dimension maintainability, the last open node-dimension\n- Sources read before work: lineage steer.md (absent), frontier block for F-2-006 maintainability, convergence decision for iteration 15 (CONTINUE)\n\n## Files Reviewed\n- .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-salvage.cjs:33 (LINEAGE_LOG_PATTERN), readLineageProviderCostUsd, readLineagePassSummary\n\n## Findings by Severity\n\n### P0 Findings\nNone.\n\n### P1 Findings\nNone.\n\n### P2 Findings\nNone.\n\n## Traceability Checks\n- None run this iteration.\n\n## Integration Evidence\n- `readLineageProviderCostUsd` walks `logs/` with an inline copy of the log-name regex, `/^fanout-lineage(\\.\\d+)?\\.out$/`, while `readLineagePassSummary` uses the `LINEAGE_LOG_PATTERN` constant that holds the same expression (fanout-salvage.cjs:33). That is two instances, which the restraint rule treats as similarity rather than a pattern, so it is recorded, not raised.\n- Both readers fail to unknown in the same way. One attempt log without a cost record makes the run cost null, and one attempt log without a timed event makes `flaggedPasses` null. The rotated-log policy behaves the same for cost and pass judgement, so the second of these is not a separate maintainability defect beyond OPUS-F006-P2-001.\n\n## Edge Cases\n- None new.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n- Each reader handles an unreadable or missing `logs/` directory locally and returns null or the live log instead of throwing.\n\n## Ruled Out\n- Extracting a shared logs-dir walker: two instances, no third.\n\n## Next Focus\n- Dimension: none remaining on this lineage's frontier\n- Focus area: convergence check and synthesis\n- Reason: every node in frontier_scope plus F-2-006 has all four dimensions\n- Rotation status: frontier drained\n- Required evidence: convergence.cjs stop decision\n\nReview verdict: PASS\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":756,"cache_read_input_tokens":314388,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":756},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc8dabb8-c714-45be-8a95-93ed45ba2410","uuid":"a27940e7-cff8-4a16-a0c8-5dc016833704","timestamp":"2026-11-20T19:29:32.648Z","request_id":"req_011ChEjVhrCCgbsVWu6deMw1","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01KHFD5TXEkahCERHWY33UJu":{"file_path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration/specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architecture/002-graph-engineering/007-expansive-depth-mode/review/lineages/opus/iterations/iteration-016.md","content":"# Iteration 016 - Frontier node F-2-006: maintainability\n\n## Dispatcher\n- Lineage: opus (fan-out), session fanout-opus-1795201537192-sq1ivw, generation 1\n- Frontier node: F-2-006 (depth 2), dimension maintainability, the last open node-dimension\n- Sources read before work: lineage steer.md (absent), frontier block for F-2-006 maintainability, convergence decision for iteration 15 (CONTINUE)\n\n## Files Reviewed\n- .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/fanout-salvage.cjs:33 (LINEAGE_LOG_PATTERN), readLineageProviderCostUsd, read