nchanged, because the cap counts every tool result and trips SIGTERM at :2686. The likelihood is now measured rather than inferred, at roughly 5x headroom for a slice-reading workload like this one. A lineage that reads whole large files, or runs the 24-iteration cap with broad reads, is the case that can reach it. The finding stays P2, and its \"real transcript sizes are inferred\" caveat is replaced by this measurement.\n\n## Edge Cases\n- The transcript is not byte-identical to stream-json stdout, since it adds bookkeeping rows and stream-json adds per-event envelopes. The two are the same order of magnitude, and that is all the margin claim needs.\n\n## Confirmed-Clean Surfaces\n- None new.\n\n## Ruled Out\n- Escalating OPUS-F006-P2-002: about 5x measured headroom on a representative run.\n\n## Next Focus\n- Dimension: traceability (recovery)\n- Focus area: checklist_evidence replay across the child phase folders' acceptance criteria for any row that names the range's features\n- Reason: core protocol replay before the cap\n- Rotation status: recovery passes until maxIterations (24)\n- Required evidence: file:line\n\nReview verdict: CONDITIONAL\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":791,"cache_read_input_tokens":373241,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":791},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bc8dabb8-c714-45be-8a95-93ed45ba2410","uuid":"aa36bfef-3e1c-48de-97eb-8907ef0bd9e1","timestamp":"2026-11-20T19:38:24.680Z","request_id":"req_011ChEkAt5foYU2LWJLpodEK","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_013HA4ixGGNNer1v62YdrUdX":{"file_path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/455-expansive-depth-integration/specs/system-deep-loop/loop-architectur