STATUS=FAIL through step_release_lock. An append the gateway rejected leaves the ledger and the registry disagreeing, so the verdict that follows would read a stale count.\"\n            halt: true\n            release_lock: step_release_lock\n          log: \"Adversarial self-check adjudicated {selfcheck_adjudications}; the verdict reads the refreshed registry.\"\n\n      # H-1 verdict derivation: parse findings JSONL, map highest severity to verdict\n      # - PASS: no P0 or P1 findings (P2-only or clean)\n      # - CONDITIONAL: any P1 finding or open search debt (no P0, no failed gate)\n      # - FAIL: any P0 finding, or a required quality gate (evidence, scope, coverage) still failing at the terminal stop\n      # Final line of iteration-NNN.md MUST be exactly: \"Review verdict: PASS\" / \"Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\" / \"Review verdict: FAIL\"\n      step_derive_verdict:\n        action: \"Derive review verdict from accumulated findings\"\n        note: \"ac_coverage_signal is advisory while the validation rule is INFO/default-off; include it in synthesis traceability, but do not change the exact verdict enum from this signal alone.\"\n        branch_on: \"config.fanout\"\n        if_present:\n          command: |\n            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/review-verdict.cjs \\\n              --active-p0 {p0_count} \\\n              --active-p1 {p1_count} \\\n              --active-p2 {p2_count} \\\n              --search-debt {search_debt_count} \\\n              --failed-gate-ids '{failed_required_gate_ids}'\n          working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n          wait_for_completion: true\n          bind_from_output:\n            verdict: \"verdict\"\n            has_advisories: \"has_advisories\"\n            active_p0: \"active_p0\"\n            active_p1: \"active_p1\"\n            active_p2: \"active_p2\"\n            search_debt_count: \"search_debt\"\n          on_fail: \"Halt with STATUS=FAIL through step_release_lock. The values the merge bound are the authority on a fan-out root, so an unreadable bound value must stop the run rather than let a verdict be guessed.\"\n        if_absent:\n          command: |\n            node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/review-verdict.cjs \\\n              --registry-path \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" \\\n              --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\"\n          working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n          wait_for_completion: true\n          bind_from_output:\n            verdict: \"verdict\"\n            has_advisories: \"has_advisories\"\n            active_p0: \"active_p0\"\n            active_p1: \"active_p1\"\n            active_p2: \"active_p2\"\n            search_debt_count: \"search_debt\"\n          on_fail: \"Halt with STATUS=FAIL through step_release_lock. A non-zero exit means the registry or the state log could not be read, so this stop has no verdict yet and none may be assumed.\"\n        outputs:\n          - verdict: \"PASS | CONDITIONAL | FAIL\"\n          - has_advisories: \"Boolean true when verdict is PASS and any active P2 findings exist\"\n          - active_p0: \"Active P0 count the verdict used\"\n          - active_p1: \"Active P1 count the verdict used\"\n          - active_p2: \"Active P2 count the verdict used\"\n          - ac_coverage_signal: \"exempt | disabled | pass | advisory-shortfall\"\n        contract: |\n          Every iteration-NNN.md must end with exactly: \"Review verdict: PASS\" (or CONDITIONAL or FAIL).\n          Downstream automation parses this final line via exact string match — do not vary the format.\n\n      step_emit_resource_map:\n        skip_when: \"config.fanout is present\"\n        action: \"Emit {state_paths.resource_map_output} from converged review deltas unless config.resource_map.emit is false\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"reducer-refresh\"","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UHsazhTPm1LVks3kLHPSvb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
